@startuml
[*] --> Idle

Idle --> AddingUser : Add New User
Idle --> EditingUser : Edit Existing User
Idle --> DeletingUser : Delete User
Idle --> ViewingProfile : View Profile

AddingUser --> Idle : Cancel
AddingUser --> ViewingProfile : Add and View
AddingUser --> [*] : Complete

EditingUser --> Idle : Cancel
EditingUser --> ViewingProfile : Edit and View
EditingUser --> [*] : Complete

DeletingUser --> Idle : Cancel
DeletingUser --> [*] : Delete

ViewingProfile --> Idle : Back
ViewingProfile --> EditingUser : Edit
ViewingProfile --> DeletingUser : Delete

Idle --> [*] : Logout
@enduml
